{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Related P1 incident deserved-rubidium-pussycat (7744-3e35-b2c4-40c2): Gerrit receive-pack temporarily rejected uploads with JGit MissingObjectException for recently merged tree objects while BuildKit/root-disk pressure alarms were active/stale. Recovery was backup-first (snapshot snap-058fc28c74eba365e), mirror fetch + fsck, scratch upload verification, and BuildKit prune to 0B. Prevention signal: bounded disk-ceiling design should preserve meaningful BuildKit/root alarms and backup-first object-store recovery guidance; avoid aggressive GC until repo fsck is clean."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788834681368214001,"uuid":"beaf5752-1bfb-4f60-9bfe-88a3e78ea886"}